# The reactos-liminal commit that builds QAGRR. Read by build-with-rl.sh: the first line that is not a comment is the full commit hash.
# The reactos-liminal commit that builds QAGRR. It is the head of reactos-liminal pull request 40 (the compact trim drops the Logon ScreenSaver and keeps Blank screen, `ScreenSaverIsSecure` is cleared), on top of main with the Afterglow savers build (pull request 39, RL-67) and the round-4 icons. The Quill remix adds AGQUILL.SCR (Ghostwriter) on top. Once pull request 40 merges, move this to its merge commit on main. To move: set a newer commit, then run
# `build-with-rl.sh --check-trim` and a dry run.
